Revision history for Git-MoreHooks

0.020     2026-10-11 00:32:16+02:00 Europe/Stockholm
            * Add Git::Mailmap to TestSuggests prereqs.
            * Add more debugging to TriggerJenkins.
            * Remove Test::DistManifest because .test.requires.git.lock file.
            * Remove dependency to perl 5.030.
            * Remove literal tabs from test file.
            * Remove unused sub arguments in ScanCtags.
            * Remove `say` from ScanCtags.
            * Reactivate pod-spell stopwords in dist.ini.
            * Remove B::Lint check from CheckPerl. It was never active.
            * Disable synopsis checking in ScanCtags.
            * Remove specific Perl version dependency from ScanCtags.
            * Remove Git::Hooks version dependency from libs and add to dist.ini.
            * Remove whitespace in EOL in CheckPerl.
            * Convert dist.ini to use @MIKKOI bundle.
            * Configure Perl requirements.
            * Add GitHub Actions workflows and dependabot.
            * Update README.md .weavefilerc.
            * Update Contribution policy.
            * Add Software::Policies / MaintainerSuccession.
            * Add CheckTrailers. Enforces a commit message trailer policy:
                a deny list, a require list and an optional required order.
                Ships with no trailer names configured and does nothing until
                a repository names its own.
            * GitRepoAdmin: a repository with no .git-repo-admin directory no
                longer throws. The state means the hooks are not installed
                there yet, which reaches every clone before anybody runs
                client-hooks.sh --install, and this plugin runs from
                post-merge, so throwing meant git pull died.

